  "body": "<p>Discord implements various caps, or limits, and restrictions across accounts, servers, and features to maintain performance and prevent abuse. Whether you're managing a community or just chatting with friends, understanding Discord's built-in limitations helps you navigate the platform effectively and avoid common frustrations.</p><p>Here's your complete guide to Discord's key restrictions and what they mean for your experience.</p><div class=\"toc-box\">\n<p><span class=\"wysiwyg-font-size-x-large\"><strong>What this article covers:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e554d6756a5d3cba890ab1f47d42164e2\"><a href=\"#h_01K0YRW1WNXGTMED3AZE0K6JBE\">Account Caps</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e92fa499b0e08a6dc65a6b3fe782d7c0d\"><a href=\"#h_01K0YRW1XP13WNJE84D7J97VN7\">Server Caps</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ecbf5c0db1fdd1c942db97d450f8f0a60\"><a href=\"#h_01K0YRW1ZBEDTTW88PQ4V0BFA1\">Stage Channel Caps</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec31b96c2de90d5898d529120c977adb1\"><a href=\"#h_01K0YRW1ZN6KR7W393C52FETPG\">Server Thread Caps</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><div class=\"tip-box\">\n<strong>Tip:</strong> <span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">In the tables below, <strong>Same</strong> means the limit is identical to the Base tier, and <strong>N/A</strong> means that feature isn't available for that tier.</span>\n</div><h1 id=\"h_01K0YRW1WNXGTMED3AZE0K6JBE\">Account Caps</h1><div><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table\"><table class=\"wysiwyg-table-resized\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 25%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 26%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 24%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 25%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Account</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Base</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Basic</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Nitro</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Number of servers</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">100</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">200</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Number of Friends (Can still have/receive unanswered friend requests)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">1000 </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">File Sharing Limit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">10MB</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50MB</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">500MB</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Length of Uploaded File Name</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">100</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Users in a DM</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">10</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Minimum password length</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">6 characters</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Message length</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">2000 character</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">4000 character</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Maximum Number of supported DMs/Mentions</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">15,000</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Length of uploaded file name including extension</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">1,024</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040816151-Go-Live-and-Screen-Share\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Screenshare </span></a><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">(DMs)</span>\n</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">720p @ 30fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">720p @ 60fps / 1080p @30fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">720p, 1080p, source @30 &amp; 60 fps</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Go Live (DMs)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">730p @ 30fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">1080p @ 60fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Source @ 60 fps</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"># of DMs in Sidebar</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">100</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Max # of Blocked Users</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">5,000</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Max Characters user notes</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">500</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Maximum User Notes Per Account</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">1,500</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Search Results Limit (before showing the broken magnifying glass)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">5000 individual results or 200 pages</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure></div><h1 id=\"h_01K0YRW1XP13WNJE84D7J97VN7\">Server Caps</h1><div class=\"tip-box\">\n<strong>Tip:</strong> To increase the level of your server and unlock additional perks, you can do so through Server Boosting. Learn more about this through the <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360028038352-Server-Boosting-FAQ\">Server Boosting FAQ article</a>\n</div><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table\"><table class=\"wysiwyg-table-resized\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 27%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 18%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 18%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 18%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 19%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Servers</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Base</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Level 1</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Level 2</strong></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"><strong>Level 3</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Emotes/Emojis</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">100</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">150</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">250</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Sticker Slots</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">5</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">15</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">30</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">60</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Upload</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">10MB</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50MB for all members</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">100MB for all members</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Soundboard Slots</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">8</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">24</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">36</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">48</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Stream Quality</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">720p @ 30fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">720p @ 60fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Audio Quality</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">96kbps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">128kbps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">256kbps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">384kbps</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040816151-Go-Live-and-Screen-Share\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Go Live Streams</span></a></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">720p @ 60fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">1080p @ 60fps</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040816151-Go-Live-and-Screen-Share\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Go Live</span></a></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50 members</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041721052-Video-Calls\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Video Channel Screen share without video</span></a></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50 members</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Voice Channel with video</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">25 members</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Vanity URL</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">N/A</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">N/A</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">N/A</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">25 characters</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Animated Server Icon</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Yes</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Yes</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Server Banner</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Static</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Animated</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Custom Role Icons</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/115001542132-Custom-Invite-Link\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Custom Invite Link</span></a></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Yes</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Total Member Count</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">25 million</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Max time before being disconnected on RTC connecting</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">3 minutes</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No push notifications on mobile for all messages</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Servers over 2,500 members</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Character limit for role name</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">100</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/115001580171-Channel-Categories-101\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Server categories</span></a></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Unique invite codes per server</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">999</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/214836687-Discord-Roles-and-Permissions\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Roles</span></a></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">250</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Channels (includes voice/text/categories)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">500</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Max number of channels in one category</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Number of days an entry remains in a server's audit log</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">45 days</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Number of followed announcement channels per 1 channel</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">10</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Total member count for offline list to remain visible</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Under 1,000</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Total member count for offline list to reappear after being hidden at 1,000+</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Under 800</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure><h1 id=\"h_01K0YRW1ZBEDTTW88PQ4V0BFA1\">Stage Channel Caps</h1><div class=\"book-box\">\n<strong>Want to learn more?</strong> <br>You can learn more about Stage Channels through the <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500005513722-Stage-Channels-FAQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"wysiwyg-underline\">Stage Channels FAQ article</span></a><span style=\"color: #434343;\">.</span>\n</div><div><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table\"><table class=\"wysiwyg-table-resized\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 31%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 18%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Stages</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Base</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Level 1</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Level 2</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Level 3</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Users (Without Streaming/Video)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">10k</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Activities on Stages</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">None</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Video Stage Seats</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">150</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">300 (Plus 30 per additional boost past 14)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Number of Stage Channels in a Server</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No Limit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No limit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No limit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No limit</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Number of Hands Raised at Once </span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No Limit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No limit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No limit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No limit</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Max number of shared screens on stage</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">1 (no camera limit, though)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Max number of messages to be sent per min/hour</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">No limit <em>unless</em> slow mode is turned on</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure></div><h1 id=\"h_01K0YRW1ZN6KR7W393C52FETPG\">Server Thread Caps</h1><div class=\"book-box\">\n<strong>Want to learn more?</strong> <br>You can learn more about Threads through the <a href=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/4403205878423-Threads-FAQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Threads FAQ article</a>.</div><div><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table\"><table class=\"wysiwyg-table-resized\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: auto;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 20%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 20%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 20%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 20%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 20%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Threads</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Base</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Level 1</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Level 2</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Level 3</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Threads</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">3 days archive (default)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Server members in a private OR public thread</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">1000</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Max # of roles mentioned in a private thread</span></td>\n<td>250</td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #2e3338;\">Same</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure></div>",
